Start the program.
Initialize the head pointer to NULL.
Display the menu of operations.
Accept the user's choice.
Perform the selected operation:
Insert: Enter roll number, name, and marks; create a new node and insert it at the end.
Display: Traverse the linked list and print all student records.
Search: Find and display the record matching the entered roll number.
Delete: Find the specified roll number and remove its node.
Update: Search by roll number and modify the student's name and marks.
Sort: Arrange the student records by marks in descending order.
Exit: Terminate the program.
Display the operation result.
If the choice is not 7, return to the menu.
Stop.
